                <mxCell id="RULES" value="&lt;b&gt;What the picture enforces&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• name_ids has one exit, into Stage A. Downstream of A_i no name exists.&lt;br&gt;• direction_ids has one exit, into the mapper. The carver sees a direction only as the shape of F_i.&lt;br&gt;• B(I) has one input, the image, so it knows nothing of the prompt.&lt;br&gt;• The null head reads four numbers and no pixels.&lt;br&gt;• Stage A's feature pyramid never leaves its box. Only the detached probabilities do." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B0BEC5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
